<UserControl x:Class="OcrNet.App.Views.DesignerView"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:OcrNet.App.Controls"
             xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime"
             ToolTipService.ShowDuration="60000" ToolTipService.InitialShowDelay="300"
             x:Name="Root">
    <UserControl.Resources>
        <sys:String x:Key="PresetHelp">A tuned starting point: sets the output classes, the hidden layers and the training settings together. Pick the one closest to what you want to recognize, then adjust.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="ClassesHelp">Each class gets one output neuron. More classes make the task harder: the network must draw finer distinctions, so it needs more capacity (wider layers), more samples per epoch and more epochs. Characters that look alike on their own (0/O, 1/l/I, c/C) cap the accuracy any network can reach.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="UnitsHelp">Width: the number of neurons in this layer, i.e. how many different features it can detect. Too narrow underfits (training and validation accuracy both low). Too wide costs time in proportion and can memorize the training fonts (training accuracy well above validation). Keep every layer comfortably wider than the number of classes.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="ActivationHelp">The nonlinearity after the layer. ReLU: fast, the default. LeakyReLU: avoids neurons that stop learning, with similar accuracy. GELU: smooth, sometimes slightly better, but slower. Tanh/Sigmoid: saturate and learn slowly in hidden layers.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="DropoutHelp">The fraction of this layer's outputs randomly switched off on each training step (inference uses all of them). It makes the network generalize better to fonts and handwriting it has not seen. Typical values are 0.1–0.3; above 0.5 the network underfits. Wider layers tolerate more.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="BatchNormHelp">Batch normalization rescales the layer's outputs per mini-batch. It makes stacks of three or more layers train faster and more stably and tolerate higher learning rates, at a small cost per step. With one or two layers it rarely matters.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="DepthHelp">Depth: one hidden layer learns stroke detectors, and a second combines them into parts of characters. For 28×28 glyphs a fully connected network gains little beyond 2–3 layers, and every layer adds training time.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="InitHelp">The starting scale of the random weights. Auto picks He for ReLU-family activations and Xavier for Tanh/Sigmoid. A mismatch mostly slows the first epochs; the final accuracy is usually similar.</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="SeedHelp">The same seed and settings produce an identical network and training run. Change it to see how much results vary from run to run (usually a few tenths of a percent).</sys:String>
        <sys:String x:Key="ResultsHelp">On the Training tab, if training and validation accuracy are both low, the network is too small or needs more epochs: add width or a layer. If training accuracy is well above validation, it is memorizing the training fonts: add dropout or stronger augmentation, or use fewer units.</sys:String>
    </UserControl.Resources>
    <Grid Margin="4,12,4,8">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="470" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="16" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

        <ScrollViewer Grid.Column="0" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Padding="0,0,8,0">
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="Start from a preset" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                        <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding Presets}" SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedPreset}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" ToolTip="{StaticResource PresetHelp}" />
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedPreset.Description}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="Model" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource FormRow}">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Text="Name" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" />
                            <TextBox Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding ModelName, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" />
                        </Grid>
                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource FormRow}">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Text="Description" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,8,12,0" />
                            <TextBox Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Description}" TextWrapping="Wrap" AcceptsReturn="True" MinHeight="56" />
                        </Grid>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="Output classes" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" ToolTip="{StaticResource ClassesHelp}" />
                        <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding CharacterSetNames}" SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedCharacterSetName}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                  ToolTip="{StaticResource ClassesHelp}" />
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding IsCustomSet, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibility}}" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="Characters (one class each)" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,0,4" />
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding CustomCharacters, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="Hidden layers (depth and width)" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" ToolTip="{StaticResource DepthHelp}" />
                        <Grid Margin="0,0,0,6">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="28" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="86" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="120" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="72" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="44" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="Units ⓘ" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" ToolTip="{StaticResource UnitsHelp}" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="Activation ⓘ" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,0,0" ToolTip="{StaticResource ActivationHelp}" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="Dropout ⓘ" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,0,0" ToolTip="{StaticResource DropoutHelp}" />
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="BN ⓘ" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,0,0" ToolTip="{StaticResource BatchNormHelp}" />
                        </Grid>
                        <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Layers}">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="28" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="86" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="120" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="72" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="44" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="{StaticResource SignalBrush}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                        <TextBox Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Units}" Style="{StaticResource NumberBox}" MinWidth="0" ToolTip="{StaticResource UnitsHelp}" />
                                        <ComboBox Grid.Column="2" Margin="6,0,0,0" ItemsSource="{Binding DataContext.Activations, ElementName=Root}" SelectedItem="{Binding Activation}"
                                                  ToolTip="{StaticResource ActivationHelp}" />
                                        <TextBox Grid.Column="3" Margin="6,0,0,0" Text="{Binding Dropout}" Style="{StaticResource NumberBox}" MinWidth="0" ToolTip="{StaticResource DropoutHelp}" />
                                        <CheckBox Grid.Column="4" Margin="10,0,0,0" IsChecked="{Binding BatchNorm}" MinWidth="0" ToolTip="{StaticResource BatchNormHelp}" />
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="5" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                                            <Button Content="↑" Padding="8,4" Command="{Binding DataContext.MoveUpCommand, ElementName=Root}" CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="Move up" />
                                            <Button Content="↓" Padding="8,4" Margin="4,0" Command="{Binding DataContext.MoveDownCommand, ElementName=Root}" CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="Move down" />
                                            <Button Content="✕" Padding="8,4" Command="{Binding DataContext.RemoveLayerCommand, ElementName=Root}" CommandParameter="{Binding}" ToolTip="Remove layer" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl>
                        <Button Content="+ Add hidden layer" Command="{Binding AddLayerCommand}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,4,0,0" ToolTip="{StaticResource DepthHelp}" />
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0"
                                   Text="Each block is Dense → [BatchNorm] → activation → Dropout. The output layer (one unit per class, softmax) is added automatically." />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="Initialization" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource FormRow}">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Text="Weight init" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" ToolTip="{StaticResource InitHelp}" />
                            <ComboBox Grid.Column="1" ItemsSource="{Binding WeightInits}" SelectedItem="{Binding WeightInit}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" ToolTip="{StaticResource InitHelp}" />
                        </Grid>
                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource FormRow}">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="110" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Text="Seed" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" ToolTip="{StaticResource SeedHelp}" />
                            <TextBox Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Seed}" Style="{StaticResource NumberBox}" ToolTip="{StaticResource SeedHelp}" />
                        </Grid>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Button Content="Build new network" Command="{Binding BuildCommand}" Style="{DynamicResource AccentButtonStyle}"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="12,10" />
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Error}" Foreground="{StaticResource NegativeBrush}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0" />
            </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>

        <Grid Grid.Column="2">
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                <RowDefinition Height="*" MinHeight="240" />
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="Summary" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Preview}" FontFamily="{StaticResource MonoFont}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,6" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Summary}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <!-- Guidance: how the design suits the selected output classes, plus a reference for each parameter. -->
            <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding GuidanceTitle}" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Recommendation}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,10" />
                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Advice}">
                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate>
                                <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,6">
                                    <Ellipse x:Name="Dot" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="8" Height="8" Margin="2,5,10,0" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                             Fill="{StaticResource ValidationBrush}" />
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
                                </DockPanel>
                                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Level}" Value="Good">
                                        <Setter TargetName="Dot" Property="Fill" Value="{StaticResource SignalBrush}" />
                                    </DataTrigger>
                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Level}" Value="Warning">
                                        <Setter TargetName="Dot" Property="Fill" Value="{StaticResource HighlightBrush}" />
                                    </DataTrigger>
                                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl>
                    <Expander Header="How each design parameter affects the result" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                        <ScrollViewer MaxHeight="300" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <StackPanel.Resources>
                                    <Style TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Caption}">
                                        <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,8" />
                                    </Style>
                                </StackPanel.Resources>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Output classes. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource ClassesHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Depth. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource DepthHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Units. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource UnitsHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Activation. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource ActivationHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Dropout. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource DropoutHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Batch norm. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource BatchNormHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Weight init. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource InitHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Seed. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource SeedHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                                <TextBlock><Run Text="Reading the results. " Foreground="{StaticResource TextBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" /><Run Text="{StaticResource ResultsHelp}" /></TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </ScrollViewer>
                    </Expander>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Margin="0">
                <DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Top" Text="Architecture preview (untrained weights)" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" />
                    <controls:NetworkGraphControl Network="{Binding Preview}" MaxNodes="14" EdgesPerNode="4" ShowMostActive="False" />
                </DockPanel>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
